<title>LATVIA: LATVIAN CENTRAL BANK SETS UNCHANGED 1.5 PCT DEPO RATE.</title>
<headline>LATVIAN CENTRAL BANK SETS UNCHANGED 1.5 PCT DEPO RATE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday set an unchanged 1.5 percent rate for banks to deposits funds with the bank for 31 days.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement it will accept deposits for 31 days on July 14 with a payment date of August 14.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
